rriculum. Every row remains provisional until compared with the official grade document.\n\n## Source register\n\n| Code | Source document | Date / version | Public location | Use in this matrix |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| S1 | NERDC, *Revised 9-Year Basic Education Curriculum Implementation Strategy* | 2025 public implementation version; exact issue date not printed in the PDF | https://nerdc.gov.ng/content_manager/Revised%209%20Year%20BEC%20Implementation%20Strategy%203.pdf | Official context only: competency framework, citizenship, cultural/global awareness, digital responsibility, entrepreneurship, environment/sustainability, gender sensitivity, SCS subject listing, and phased implementation. No grade topics. |\n| S2 | NERDC, *Special Notice on the List of Approved Subjects/Offerings for the Newly Revised Basic and Senior Secondary Education Curriculum* | 8 September 2025 | https://www.nerdc.gov.ng/content_manager/Press%20Release%20On%20New%20FG%20Curriculum.pdf | Official confirmation that Social and Citizenship Studies is a separate subject at P1–3 and P4–6. No grade topics. |\n| S3 | SchemeofWork.com, *Primary 3 Scheme of Work Unified* — Social and Citizenship Studies sections | Public unified scheme page, undated; accessed 2026-07-14 | https://schemeofwork.com/primary-3-scheme-of-work-unified/ | Newer public, publisher-described NERDC/NAPPS-aligned P3 SCS topic sequence. Not an official NERDC publication. |\n| S4 | SchemeofWork.com, *Primary 4 Scheme of Work Unified* — Social and Citizenship Studies sections | Public unified scheme page, undated; accessed 2026-07-14 | https://schemeofwork.com/primary-4-scheme-of-work-unified/ | Newer public, publisher-described NERDC/NAPPS-aligned P4 SCS topic sequence. Not an official NERDC publication. |\n| S5 | SchemeofWork.com, *Primary 5 Scheme of Work Unified* — Social and Citizenship Studies sections | Public unified scheme page, undated; accessed 2026-07-14 | https://schemeofwork.com/primary-5-scheme-of-work-unified/